WEBVTT

00:08.862 --> 00:10.758
- ARE YOU READY, KIDS?
- 孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.862 --> 00:12.517
kids: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：是啊，是啊，队长！

00:12.620 --> 00:13.965
- I CAN'T HEAR YOU.
- 我听不到你说话。

00:14.068 --> 00:15.793
kids: AYE, AYE, CAPTAIN!
孩子们：是啊，是啊，队长！

00:15.896 --> 00:18.724
- ♪ OHH...
- ♪ 噢...

00:18.827 --> 00:21.068
♪ WHO LIVES IN A PINEAPPLE
UNDER THE SEA? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:21.172 --> 00:23.172
kids: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
孩子们：海绵宝宝！

00:23.275 --> 00:25.103
- ♪ ABSORBENT AND YELLOW
AND POROUS IS HE ♪
- ♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:25.206 --> 00:26.724
kids: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
孩子们：海绵宝宝！

00:26.827 --> 00:29.103
- ♪ IF NAUTICAL NONSENSE
BE SOMETHING YOU WISH ♪
- ♪ 如果航海废话
成为你所希望的 ♪

00:29.206 --> 00:30.620
kids: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
孩子们：海绵宝宝！

00:30.724 --> 00:33.103
- ♪ THEN DROP ON THE DECK
AND FLOP LIKE A FISH ♪
- ♪ 然后掉到甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:33.206 --> 00:35.000
kids: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
- READY?
孩子们：海绵宝宝！
- 准备好？

00:35.103 --> 00:37.068
all: SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
所有：海绵宝宝！

00:37.172 --> 00:38.965
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:39.068 --> 00:40.931
SPONGEBOB SQUAREPANTS!
海绵宝宝！

00:41.034 --> 00:42.000
- SPONGEBOB
- 海绵宝宝

00:42.103 --> 00:44.482
SQUAREPANTS!
方裤！

00:44.586 --> 00:45.965
[laughing]
[笑]

00:46.068 --> 00:49.068
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

00:49.172 --> 00:50.000
[waves crashing]
[海浪拍打]

00:52.344 --> 00:55.379
[lilting ukulele music]
[轻快的尤克里里音乐]

00:55.482 --> 01:02.241
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

01:06.137 --> 01:07.103
[tuning note]
[调音注意事项]

01:07.206 --> 01:08.862
[whistling]
[吹口哨]

01:10.172 --> 01:11.620
[harmonic hissing]
[和谐的嘶嘶声]

01:11.724 --> 01:14.517
together:
[whistling and hissing]
一起：
[口哨声和嘶嘶声]

01:14.620 --> 01:17.034
- SPONGEBOB, WHAT IS THAT
HORRIBLE RACKET
- 海绵宝宝，那是什么
可怕的球拍

01:17.137 --> 01:18.517
COMING FROM BACK HERE?
从这里回来？

01:18.620 --> 01:21.206
- JUST A LITTLE
GRILL-SIDE HARMONY.
- 只是一点点
烤架和谐。

01:21.310 --> 01:23.344
EVERYONE KNOWS THAT COOKING AND
MUSIC GO TOGETHER LIKE
每个人都知道烹饪和
音乐一起走

01:23.448 --> 01:25.724
EATING AND LISTENING.
吃和听。

01:25.827 --> 01:29.344
- YOU WOULDN'T KNOW WHAT MUSIC
IS IF IT CAME UP
- 你不会知道什么音乐
如果它出现了

01:29.448 --> 01:30.965
AND HIT YOU IN THE FACE.
然后打你的脸。

01:31.068 --> 01:32.689
- HEY, THAT HAPPENED TO
PATRICK ONCE.
- 嘿，事情发生了
帕特里克曾经。

01:32.793 --> 01:35.793
HE MUST'VE BEEN LISTENING
TO HARD ROCK.
他一定一直在听
到硬摇滚。

01:35.896 --> 01:36.827
HE HAD A LUMP ON HIS HEAD--
他头上有一个肿块——

01:36.931 --> 01:38.275
- I DON'T CARE!
- 我不在乎！

01:38.379 --> 01:41.310
- IF YOU WANT TO HEAR WHAT
REALMUSIC SOUNDS LIKE,
- 如果您想听什么
真实的音乐听起来像，

01:41.413 --> 01:45.551
THEN LISTEN TO THIS.
然后听听这个。

01:45.655 --> 01:46.758
[clarinet music]
[单簧管音乐]

01:46.862 --> 01:51.689
[all uttering disagreements]
[大家都发表不同意见]

01:51.793 --> 01:54.586
- HEY, GIVE IT BACK.
I WAS JUST REACHING MY CODA.
- 嘿，把它还给我。
我刚刚到达尾声。

01:54.689 --> 01:55.689
- YEAH?
- 是的？

01:55.793 --> 01:57.448
WELL, YOUR CODA IS
AFFECTING ME QUOTA.
好吧，你的尾声是
影响我的配额。

01:57.551 --> 02:00.068
THE SHREW, PIERCING RACKET
OF YOUR FISH FLUTE
泼妇，刺穿球拍
您的鱼笛

02:00.172 --> 02:00.724
IS FRIGHTENING AWAY ME MONEY.
吓跑了我的钱。

02:00.827 --> 02:02.413
- FISH FLUTE.
- 鱼笛。

02:02.517 --> 02:04.103
- WELL, I DON'T KNOW.
- 嗯，我不知道。

02:04.206 --> 02:05.482
THAT'S WHAT THEY USED
TO CALL IT.
这就是他们用的
调用它。

02:05.586 --> 02:08.206
- NONE OF YOU SIMPLETONS WOULD
RECOGNIZE REAL MUSIC TALENT
-你们这些傻瓜都不会
认识真正的音乐人才

02:08.310 --> 02:10.758
IF IT CAME UP
AND KICKED YOU IN THE FACE.
如果它出现了
并踢了你的脸。

02:10.862 --> 02:13.137
- HEY, THAT HAPPENED TO
PATRICK ONCE, TOO.
- 嘿，事情发生了
帕特里克也曾经。

02:13.241 --> 02:14.689
HEY--
嘿 -

02:14.793 --> 02:17.137
- NONE OF YOU KNOW A GREAT
MUSICIAN WHEN YOU HEAR HIM.
- 你们都不知道伟大的人
当你听到他的声音时，他就是音乐家。

02:17.241 --> 02:19.068
NONE I SAY.
NO ONE OF YOU.
我没说。
你们中没有人。

02:19.172 --> 02:20.689
NOT EVEN, EVEN--
不，甚至——

02:20.793 --> 02:22.551
OH, THERE'S NOBODY THERE.
哦，那里没有人。

02:22.655 --> 02:24.758
- HE'S STILL DOING IT, KAREN.
- 他还在做，凯伦。

02:24.862 --> 02:25.862
HE'S--KAREN?
他是——凯伦？

02:25.965 --> 02:27.931
- WHO'S DOING WHAT NOW?
- 谁现在在做什么？

02:28.034 --> 02:29.620
- THE SKINNY ONE.
- 瘦的那一款。

02:29.724 --> 02:32.137
HE'S BEEN RANTING AND RAVING
IN FRONT OF THE KRUSTY KRAB
他一直在咆哮和胡言乱语
甲壳蟹前

02:32.241 --> 02:33.862
FOR THE PAST HALF-HOUR.
过去的半个小时。

02:33.965 --> 02:36.241
WAVING HIS ARMS AND JUMPING
AROUND LIKE AN ANIMAL.
挥动手臂跳跃
像动物一样围绕。

02:36.344 --> 02:37.620
OH, HE STOPPED NOW.
哦，他现在停了下来。

02:37.724 --> 02:40.620
HE'S JUST BROKEN DOWN
ON THE GROUND CRYING.
他刚刚崩溃了
在地上哭泣。

02:40.724 --> 02:42.448
KAREN, KAREN!
凯伦，凯伦！

02:42.551 --> 02:43.448
FOR THE FIRST TIME IT'S HIT ME.
这是我第一次受到打击。

02:43.551 --> 02:45.379
- WHAT?
THE DOOR ON YOUR WAY OUT?
- 什么？
你出去的门在吗？

02:45.482 --> 02:47.103
- NO, COMPUTER BRAIN.
- 不，电脑大脑。

02:47.206 --> 02:50.620
THE SKINNY ONE MAY HAVE BEEN THE
GATEWAY TO THE SECRET FORMULA
瘦的可能是
通往秘密配方的大门

02:50.724 --> 02:52.034
ALL ALONG.
一直。

02:52.137 --> 02:55.931
AS A VETERAN EMPLOYEE, HE MUST
KNOW THE SECRET FORMULA TOO.
作为一名资深员工，他必须
也知道秘密公式。

02:56.034 --> 02:57.689
- [sighs]
I WARNED YOU AGAINST IT.
- [叹气]
我警告过你不要这样做。

02:57.793 --> 02:59.655
- TOO LATE!
- 为时已晚！

02:59.758 --> 03:01.310
[evil laughter]
[邪恶的笑声]

03:01.413 --> 03:04.551
[Hawaiian-style music]
【夏威夷风格的音乐】

03:04.655 --> 03:06.206
- AHEM.
- 咳咳。

03:06.310 --> 03:07.793
- WHO SAID THAT?
- DOWN HERE.
- 谁说的？
- 在这里。

03:07.896 --> 03:10.551
I AM JUST AN INNOCENT PASSERBY
WHO FELT THE NEED
我只是一个无辜的路人
谁感受到了需要

03:10.655 --> 03:14.344
TO STOP AND TELL YOU WHAT A
MAGNIFICENT GARDEN YOU HAVE.
停下来告诉你什么是
你拥有的宏伟花园。

03:14.448 --> 03:16.827
- OH, REALLY?
- YES.
- 哦真的吗？
- 是的。

03:16.931 --> 03:18.931
- WELL, LET ME TELL YOU
SOMETHING, MISTER.
- 好吧，让我告诉你
有事，先生。

03:19.034 --> 03:21.931
I KNOW EXACTLY WHO YOU ARE
AND WHY YOU'RE HERE.
我完全知道你是谁
以及你为什么在这里。

03:22.034 --> 03:23.310
- YOU DO?
- 你做？

03:23.413 --> 03:26.206
- YOU WILL NOT GET ME TO EAT
AT THE CHUM BUCKET.
- 你不准我吃饭
在鱼缸里。

03:26.310 --> 03:28.275
NO MATTER HOW BIG
THE DISCOUNT IS.
无论多大
折扣是。

03:28.379 --> 03:31.689
- WELL, THAT'S NOT
EXACTLY WHY I--
- 嗯，那不是
到底为什么我——

03:31.793 --> 03:34.965
[gurgling]
[淙淙]

03:35.068 --> 03:35.206
- SHAMELESS.
- 无耻。

03:39.241 --> 03:40.586
- YOU AGAIN!
- 又是你！

03:40.689 --> 03:43.137
- I HOPE YOU DON'T MIND ME
PAINTING ON YOUR PROPERTY,
- 我希望你不要介意我
在您的财产上绘画，

03:43.241 --> 03:47.344
BUT THE LIGHT HERE IS SIMPLY
TRANSCENDENT THIS TIME OF DAY.
但这里的光只是
一天中的这个时刻是超越的。

03:47.448 --> 03:50.137
- WHY, YES, IT IS,
ISN'T IT?
- 为什么，是的，是的，
不是吗？

03:50.241 --> 03:53.137
- YES!
IT--
- 是的！
它 -

03:53.241 --> 03:55.206
NOT BUYING THAT ONE
EITHER, HUH?
不买那个
要么，嗯？

03:55.310 --> 03:56.448
- NOPE.
- 没有。

03:58.793 --> 03:59.758
- HEY, BUDDY!
- 嘿，伙计！

03:59.862 --> 04:01.379
SQUIDWARD!
章鱼哥！

04:01.482 --> 04:03.241
FREE CLEANING SERVICE?
免费清洁服务？

04:03.344 --> 04:04.482
CENSUS TAKER.
人口普查员。

04:04.586 --> 04:06.310
GOOD DAY, KIND SIR.
美好的一天，善良的先生。

04:06.413 --> 04:08.689
WOULD YOU LIKE TO BUY SOME GIL
SCOUT COOKIES?
你想买一些吉尔吗
侦察饼干？

04:08.793 --> 04:09.344
- YEOOOW!
- 耶！

04:13.275 --> 04:14.793
- PLANKTON, WHAT ARE YOU DOING?
- 浮游生物，你在做什么？

04:14.896 --> 04:16.448
- THERE'S NOTHING A
LITTLE DUCT TAPE
- 没有什么
小胶带

04:16.551 --> 04:19.931
AND SURGICAL TUBING
CAN'T ACCOMPLISH.
和手术管
无法完成。

04:26.413 --> 04:28.482
I KNEW I SHOULD'VE
USED PIPE CLEANERS.
我知道我应该
使用过的管道清洁剂。

04:28.586 --> 04:31.137
HELLO, I'M YOUR
LONG LOST RELATIVE.
你好，我是你的
失散多年的亲人。

04:31.241 --> 04:33.000
CAN I HAVE THE SECRET FORMULA?
我可以有秘密配方吗？

04:36.103 --> 04:39.172
WELL, THAT'S A FINE WAY
TO TREAT A FAMILY MEMBER.
嗯，这是一个好方法
治疗家庭成员。

04:39.275 --> 04:41.275
- HI, PLANKTON.
NICE DRESS.
- 嗨，浮游生物。
漂亮的衣服。

04:41.379 --> 04:43.379
- OUT OF MY WAY, SPONGE BRAIN.
- 别挡我的路，海绵大脑。

04:43.482 --> 04:45.172
- I OVERHEARD YOU AND SQUIDWARD
PLAYING DOOR SLAM,
- 我无意中听到你和章鱼哥
玩“关门”游戏，

04:45.275 --> 04:47.620
AND I WANTED TO SEE IF I COULD
GET IN ON THE NEXT ROUND.
我想看看我是否可以
进入下一轮。

04:47.724 --> 04:48.793
- [crying]
- [哭泣]

04:48.896 --> 04:51.172
- DON'T CRY, PLANKTON.
- 别哭，浮游生物。

04:51.275 --> 04:53.724
DOOR SLAM'S EASY TO PLAY.
HARD TO MASTER.
《关门》玩法简单。
很难掌握。

04:53.827 --> 04:54.724
- NONE OF MY TACTICS ARE
MAKING ANY IMPRESSION
- 我的战术都不是
给人留下深刻印象

04:54.827 --> 04:57.965
ON HIM WHATSOEVER.
无论如何，都在他身上。

04:58.068 --> 04:59.586
- WELL, LET'S SEE.
- 好吧，让我们看看。

04:59.689 --> 05:01.620
IF YOU REALLY WANT
TO IMPRESS SQUIDWARD,
如果你真的想要
为了给章鱼哥留下深刻印象，

05:01.724 --> 05:02.379
TRY TALKING TO HIM ABOUT MUSIC.
尝试与他谈论音乐。

05:02.482 --> 05:03.379
- MUSIC?
- 音乐？

05:03.482 --> 05:05.517
- YEAH.
- 是的。

05:05.620 --> 05:06.965
ESPECIALLY HIS
FAVORITE KIND OF MUSIC.
特别是他的
最喜欢的音乐类型。

05:07.068 --> 05:08.034
HIS OWN.
他自己的。

05:08.137 --> 05:11.034
- OH, IS THAT RIGHT?
- 哦，是这样吗？

05:11.137 --> 05:14.137
[singing happily]
[快乐地唱歌]

05:14.241 --> 05:15.172
- SON OF A--
- A之子--

05:15.275 --> 05:16.206
NOT AGAIN!
不再！

05:16.310 --> 05:18.448
- WAIT, DON'T IRRIGATE ME.
- 等等，别浇我。

05:18.551 --> 05:20.724
I'VE COME TO HEAR YOUR MUSIC.
我是来听你的音乐的。

05:20.827 --> 05:24.413
IT SOOTHES THE PLACE MY SOUL
WOULD OCCUPY IF I HAD ONE.
它抚慰了我的灵魂
如果我有的话我会占用的。

05:24.517 --> 05:26.689
- ARE YOU SURE YOU'VE
GOT THE RIGHT SQUID?
- 你确定你已经
有合适的鱿鱼吗？

05:26.793 --> 05:28.551
- I'VE NEVER BEEN
SURE OF ANYTHING.
- 我从来没有去过
当然可以。

05:28.655 --> 05:30.689
BUT I AM SURE OF THIS.
但我确信这一点。

05:30.793 --> 05:31.758
PLAY FOR ME.
为我演奏。

05:31.862 --> 05:33.724
FILL MY EAR SOCKETS
WITH THE STRAINS
填满我的耳塞
与应变

05:33.827 --> 05:37.586
OF YOUR SWEET, SWEET MAGIC.
你甜蜜的魔法。

05:37.689 --> 05:41.241
- FINALLY, SOMEBODY ACTUALLY
APPRECIATES MY BRILLIANCE.
- 终于有人了
欣赏我的才华。

05:41.344 --> 05:43.758
I WILL PLAY FOR YOU
MY TINY CYCLOPS.
我会为你演奏
我的小独眼巨人。

05:43.862 --> 05:45.310
I WILL PLAY SUCH THAT
NEPTUNE HIMSELF
我会这样玩
海王星本人

05:45.413 --> 05:50.068
WILL HEAR ME UPON
HIS VERY THRONE.
会听到我的声音
他的王座。

05:50.172 --> 05:50.551
OR WHATEVER CHAIR
HE'S SITTING ON.
或者任何椅子
他坐在上面。

05:50.655 --> 05:52.379
- UH OH.
- 呃哦。

05:52.482 --> 05:54.448
I MEAN, GOODY!
我的意思是，好极了！

05:54.551 --> 06:00.896
- [clarinet playing]
- [单簧管演奏]

06:01.000 --> 06:05.034
- YEEOW!
- 哟！

06:05.137 --> 06:09.793
SWEET MOTHER OF APHRODITE,
PLEASE MAKE IT END.
阿芙罗狄蒂可爱的母亲，
请让它结束。

06:09.896 --> 06:11.275
- HEH?
HEH?
- 呵呵？
呵呵？

06:11.379 --> 06:12.517
HOW'RE YOU ENJOYING
THE MUSIC SO FAR?
你玩得怎么样
到目前为止的音乐？

06:12.620 --> 06:15.551
- IT'S DELIGHTFUL!
- 太令人愉快了！

06:19.620 --> 06:22.310
- [clarinet playing]
- [单簧管演奏]

06:22.413 --> 06:27.206
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

06:27.310 --> 06:30.172
BRAVO!
WOO-HOO-HOO-HOO!
太棒了！
呜呼呼！

06:34.689 --> 06:36.241
ENCORE!
ENCORE!
安可！
安可！

06:36.344 --> 06:37.344
YES!
YES!
是的！
是的！

06:37.448 --> 06:40.172
BRAVO!
BRAVO!
太棒了！
太棒了！

06:40.275 --> 06:41.241
WOO-HOO.
呜呼。

06:41.344 --> 06:42.586
- AH! MY VERY OWN FAN.
- 啊！我自己的粉丝。

06:42.689 --> 06:44.448
[distant clarinet]
[遥远的单簧管]

06:44.551 --> 06:46.931
- DID YOU HEAR THAT?
- HOW COULD I NOT?
- 你听到了吗？
- 我怎么能不呢？

06:47.034 --> 06:47.965
- AH!
- 啊！

06:48.068 --> 06:49.931
OH, IT'S TERRIBLE.
哦，太糟糕了。

06:50.034 --> 06:52.034
- BRAVO.
- 太棒了。

06:52.137 --> 06:54.586
- NO, NO!
MAKE IT STOP!
- 不，不！
让它停止！

07:00.068 --> 07:03.586
[all shouting in disgust]
[大家厌恶地喊叫]

07:05.172 --> 07:08.931
- ENCORE, ENCORE, ENCORE.
- 再演一次，再演一次，再演一次。

07:09.034 --> 07:11.034
- I'M SO GLAD YOU'RE ENJOYING
THE PERFORMANCE.
- 我很高兴你喜欢
性能。

07:11.137 --> 07:12.827
- ENJOYING IT?
- 喜欢吗？

07:12.931 --> 07:16.034
WHY, I'M ENJOYING IT SO MUCH,
IT'S MAKING ME WANT TO...
为什么，我非常喜欢它，
这让我想要……

07:16.137 --> 07:17.517
IT'S MAKING ME WANT TO...
这让我想要……

07:17.620 --> 07:18.931
- WANT TO SING?
- 想唱歌吗？

07:19.034 --> 07:21.482
- THAT'S THE WORD
I WAS LOOKING FOR.
- 就是这个词
我正在寻找。

07:21.586 --> 07:23.862
- A ONE, A TWO.
A ONE, TWO, THREE, FOUR.
- 一个一，两个。
一、二、三、四。

07:23.965 --> 07:28.034
[jazzy music]
[爵士乐]

07:28.137 --> 07:31.724
- ♪ SKINNY ARMS ARE FLAPPIN,'
LONG NOSE LOOKS REAL SWELL ♪
- ♪ 瘦手臂正在颤动，'
长鼻子看起来真气派♪

07:31.827 --> 07:35.241
♪ SHINY HEAD IS BULGING,
HE PLAYS REALLY WELL ♪
♪ 闪亮的头凸出，
他打得真的很好♪

07:35.344 --> 07:38.241
♪ ON THE FACT THAT HE'S A GENIUS
YOU CAN SURELY BET ♪
♪ 事实上他是个天才
你一定可以打赌 ♪

07:38.344 --> 07:44.275
♪ THE STRANGE LOOKING BLUE GUY
SURE PLAYS A MEAN CLARINET ♪
♪ 长相奇怪的蓝色家伙
肯定会吹出难听的单簧管 ♪

07:44.379 --> 07:49.896
[clarinet playing]
[单簧管演奏]

07:50.000 --> 07:53.689
♪ TO HEAR HIS MUSIC PLAYING IS
LIKE, EH, MUSIC TO MY EARS ♪
♪ 听到他的音乐演奏是
就像，呃，我耳边的音乐 ♪

07:53.793 --> 07:57.103
♪ HIS DELIGHTFUL MELODIES REDUCE
GROWN MEN TO TEARS ♪
♪ 他令人愉悦的旋律减少了
成年男人泪流满面♪

07:57.206 --> 07:58.862
♪ IF YOU HAVEN'T HEARD
THIS MOLLUSK PLAY ♪
♪ 如果你还没有听说过
这个软体动物在玩耍 ♪

07:58.965 --> 08:01.172
♪ YOU AIN'T HEARD NOTHING YET
♪ 你还什么也没听到

08:01.275 --> 08:04.758
♪ THIS FUNNY LOOKING BLUE GUY
SURE PLAYS A MEAN CLARINET ♪
♪ 这个看起来很有趣的蓝色家伙
肯定会吹出难听的单簧管 ♪

08:04.862 --> 08:09.586
[clarinet playing]
[单簧管演奏]

08:11.793 --> 08:13.793
♪ NO ONE DOES IT BETTER
♪ 没有人做得更好

08:13.896 --> 08:15.241
♪ HE'S THE BEST THERE IS
♪ 他是最棒的

08:15.344 --> 08:17.896
♪ WHEN YOU ASK HIM HOW
HE DOES IT, HE SAYS... ♪
♪ 当你问他怎么做时
他做到了，他说...♪

08:18.000 --> 08:22.689
- ♪ IT'S ALL IN THE WRIST
- ♪ 尽在腕间

08:24.931 --> 08:27.137
- HOORAY!
- 万岁！

08:27.241 --> 08:28.137
- THANK YOU.
THANK YOU.
- 谢谢。
谢谢。

08:28.241 --> 08:31.034
- SAY, UH, MUSICAL GENIUS?
- 呃，音乐天才？

08:31.137 --> 08:32.724
- YES.
- 是的。

08:32.827 --> 08:35.379
- WHEN YOU'RE NOT SHARING YOUR
SONGS OF JOY AND SPLENDOR,
- 当您不分享您的
欢乐与辉煌之歌，

08:35.482 --> 08:36.655
ONE MIGHT FIND YOU
WORKING A SHIFT
有人可能会找到你
轮班工作

08:36.758 --> 08:39.275
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB, CORRECT?
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅，对吗？

08:39.379 --> 08:40.241
- IT IS AN UNFORTUNATE TRUTH.
- 这是一个不幸的事实。

08:40.344 --> 08:42.413
- AND YOU'VE BEEN WORKING THERE
- 你一直在那里工作

08:42.517 --> 08:44.551
FOR A PRETTY LONG TIME,
HAVEN'T YOU?
相当长一段时间以来，
你没有吗？

08:44.655 --> 08:45.965
- THAT'S AN UNDERSTATEMENT.
- 这是一个轻描淡写的说法。

08:46.068 --> 08:50.068
- WELL, I WAS JUST WONDERING,
OH, INCREDIBLY MUSICAL ONE,
- 嗯，我只是想知道，
哦，令人难以置信的音乐剧，

08:50.172 --> 08:53.586
WHAT DO THEY PUT IN ONE OF THOSE
KRABBY PATTIES ANYWAY?
他们在其中一个里面放了什么
蟹肉饼有吗？

08:53.689 --> 08:54.517
SECRET-WISE.
秘密的。

08:54.620 --> 08:57.517
- OH, I DON'T WORK THE GRILL.
- 哦，我不工作烧烤。

08:57.620 --> 08:59.586
I WORK THE REGISTER.
我负责登记。

08:59.689 --> 09:01.724
- BUT...
- 但...

09:01.827 --> 09:04.620
SURELY YOU'VE BEEN
NEAR THE GRILL.
你肯定去过
靠近烧烤架。

09:04.724 --> 09:07.310
YOU MUST HAVE SEEN SOMETHING.
[laughs]
你一定已经看到了什么。
[笑]

09:07.413 --> 09:10.310
- NOPE, HAVEN'T SEEN A THING.
- 不，什么也没看到。

09:10.413 --> 09:14.103
- YOU'VE WORKED IN THE SAME
PLACE FOR 20 YEARS
- 你也曾在同一家公司工作过
20年的地位

09:14.206 --> 09:16.655
AND YOU'VE NEVER NOTICED THE
INGREDIENTS OF THE SOLE ITEM
而你从来没有注意到
单一产品的成分

09:16.758 --> 09:17.482
ON YOUR MENU?
您的菜单上有吗？

09:17.586 --> 09:21.206
CUT THE COMEDY, OCTOPUS!
剪掉喜剧吧，章鱼！

09:21.310 --> 09:23.310
I WANT THAT FORMULA
AND I WANT IT NOW.
我想要那个公式
我现在就想要。

09:23.413 --> 09:27.000
- OH, DON'T YOU SEE, SHELDON?
- 哦，你没看到吗，谢尔顿？

09:27.103 --> 09:30.103
THANKS TO YOU, I'M GETTING
BETTER AND BETTER AS A MUSICIAN.
谢谢你，我得到了
作为一名越来越好的音乐家。

09:30.206 --> 09:31.793
- WHAT?
- 什么？

09:31.896 --> 09:34.034
- IT'S BEEN YOUR CONSTANT
ENCOURAGEMENT THAT HAS HELPED ME
- 这是你的不变
对我有帮助的鼓励

09:34.137 --> 09:37.620
PROGRESS TO NEW
MUSICAL HEIGHTS.
进展到新的
音乐高峰。

09:37.724 --> 09:40.689
I'M HITTING NOTES
I NEVER EVEN KNEW EXISTED.
我正在记笔记
我从来不知道存在。

09:43.896 --> 09:48.448
- WE HAVE, OOO!
- 我们有，哦！

09:48.551 --> 09:51.517
- MAY DAY!
MAY DAY!
- 劳动节！
劳动节！

09:51.620 --> 09:53.793
- IN FACT, THANKS TO YOU,
- 事实上，谢谢你，

09:53.896 --> 09:56.655
I'M GOING TO QUIT MY JOB
AT THE KRUSTY KRAB
我要辞掉工作
在 Krusty Krab 餐厅

09:56.758 --> 09:59.241
AND BECOME A FULL-TIME
MUSICIAN.
并成为全职
音乐家。

09:59.344 --> 10:02.586
- BUT THEN I'LL NEVER GET MY
HANDS ON THAT SECRET FORMULA.
- 但那样我就永远得不到我的了
掌握这个秘密公式。

10:02.689 --> 10:05.000
UH-OH!
呃-哦！

10:05.103 --> 10:09.137
MY PROFESSIONAL GRADE EARPLUGS!
我的专业级耳塞！

10:09.241 --> 10:12.172
NO!
不！

10:17.931 --> 10:19.827
COME BACK!
I NEED YOU.
回来！
我需要你。

10:19.931 --> 10:23.793
- [clarinet playing]
- AH!
- [单簧管演奏]
- 啊！

10:26.586 --> 10:29.586
STOP PLAYING THIS INFERNAL PIPE.
别再吹这个地狱般的管子了。

10:29.689 --> 10:31.241
YOU'RE KILLING ME.
你要杀了我。

10:31.344 --> 10:34.275
- HEY!
- 嘿！

10:34.379 --> 10:35.379
COME BACK!
回来！

10:35.482 --> 10:36.827
- HI, SQUIDWARD.
- 嗨，章鱼哥。

10:36.931 --> 10:39.482
I HEARD YOU AND PLANKTON OUT
HERE PLAYING DOOR SLAM,
我听到你和浮游生物的声音
在这里玩《关门》，

10:39.586 --> 10:40.862
AND I WAS WONDERING
IF I COULD--
我想知道
如果我可以——

10:40.965 --> 10:43.620
- PLANKTON STOLE MY CLARINET,
AND I HAVE TO GET IT BACK.
- 浮游生物偷了我的单簧管，
我必须把它拿回来。

10:43.724 --> 10:45.793
- HOO!
I WANT TO PLAY!
- 呼！
我想玩！

10:45.896 --> 10:48.000
[heavy breathing]
[粗重的呼吸]

10:48.103 --> 10:49.448
- AH-HA!
- 啊哈！

10:49.551 --> 10:51.655
- OKAY, FISH FLUTE.
- 好的，鱼笛。

10:51.758 --> 10:56.275
TIME TO PLAY A LITTLE
AVANT GARDE.
玩一会儿的时间
前卫。

10:56.379 --> 11:00.448
GUARDRAIL, THAT IS.
护栏，就是这样。

11:00.551 --> 11:02.379
[evil laughter[
[邪恶的笑声[

11:02.482 --> 11:05.827
both: OH!
两人：哦！

11:05.931 --> 11:08.103
- OUCH, SQUIDWARD.
THIS GAME IS FUN.
- 哎呀，章鱼哥。
这个游戏很有趣。

11:08.206 --> 11:10.172
- YOU'LL NEVER CATCH ME,
YOU HEAR?
- 你永远抓不到我，
你听到了吗？

11:10.275 --> 11:11.586
NEVER!
绝不！

11:11.689 --> 11:14.068
- WE'VE GOT YOU SURROUNDED.
- YOU DO?
- 我们已经把你包围了。
- 你做？

11:14.172 --> 11:16.172
OH.
- WE'VE RECEIVED HUNDREDS
哦。
- 我们已经收到了数百封

11:16.275 --> 11:18.896
OF REPORTS OF AN EXCRUCIATING
MUSICAL DISTURBANCE,
令人难以忍受的报告
音乐干扰，

11:19.000 --> 11:20.379
AND YOU'RE THE ONLY ONE
HOLDING AN INSTRUMENT.
而你是唯一的一个
持有乐器。

11:20.482 --> 11:21.896
- WAIT A MINUTE.
- 等一下。

11:22.000 --> 11:23.896
I'VE NEVER SEEN THIS INSTRUMENT
BEFORE IN MY LIFE.
我从未见过这个乐器
以前在我的生活中。

11:24.000 --> 11:25.103
- HE'S RIGHT, OFFICER.
- 他是对的，警官。

11:25.206 --> 11:25.896
PLANKTON
DOESN'T EVEN PLAY CLAR--
浮游生物
甚至播放不清晰——

11:26.000 --> 11:27.758
- THERE, THERE, LADDY.
- 那里，那里，女士。

11:27.862 --> 11:30.931
JUST LET THE LEGAL SYSTEM RUN
ITS COURSE.
让法律体系运行起来
它的课程。

11:31.034 --> 11:32.896
- WATCH YOUR HEAD.
- NO!
- 小心你的头。
- 不！

11:33.000 --> 11:34.758
WAIT!
PLEASE!
等待！
请！

11:34.862 --> 11:37.793
KAREN!
HELP!
凯伦！
帮助！

11:37.896 --> 11:42.758
- OH, YOU WON'T BE NEEDING THIS
WHERE YOU'RE GOING.
- 哦，你不需要这个
你要去哪里。

11:42.862 --> 11:44.068
- BOY, THAT WAS A CLOSE
ONE, HUH, SQUIDWARD?
- 男孩，那已经很接近了
一，嗯，章鱼哥？

11:44.172 --> 11:48.586
HE ALMOST GOT YOUR CLARINET.
他几乎拿到了你的单簧管。

11:48.689 --> 11:53.724
- ONCE AGAIN, I HATE PEOPLE.
- 再说一遍，我讨厌人。

11:53.827 --> 11:55.931
[lilting ukulele music]
[轻快的尤克里里音乐]

11:56.034 --> 12:02.620
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪
♪

12:02.724 --> 12:07.827
- ♪ LA-DA-DE-LA-DA-DUM
LA-DA-DO ♪
- ♪ 拉-达-德-拉-达-杜姆
拉-达-多 ♪

12:07.931 --> 12:10.344
AH, IT'S A GREAT DAY
FOR THE ART WORLD.
啊，这是美好的一天
为了艺术世界。

12:10.448 --> 12:12.827
FAMOUS ART CRITIC
FREDERICK T. NITPICK
著名艺术评论家
弗雷德里克·T·尼特皮克

12:12.931 --> 12:17.000
WILL BE CRITIQUING MY
LATEST MASTERPIECE.
会批评我的
最新杰作。

12:17.103 --> 12:17.931
I LOVE HEARING MYSELF TALK.
我喜欢听自己说话。

12:18.034 --> 12:22.689
both: [laughing]
两人：[笑]

12:22.793 --> 12:26.275
- HI, SQUIDWARD.
WHOA, I LOVE YOUR HAT.
- 嗨，章鱼哥。
哇，我喜欢你的帽子。

12:26.379 --> 12:29.758
- DON'T TOUCH IT!
AND IT'S NOT A HAT.
- 不要碰它！
而且这不是帽子。

12:29.862 --> 12:31.482
IT'S A BERET.
- A BERET?
这是贝雷帽。
- 贝雷帽？

12:31.586 --> 12:33.689
OOOH.
WHERE CAN I GET ONE?
噢。
我在哪里可以得到一个？

12:33.793 --> 12:35.034
- SORRY, SPONGEBOB.
- 对不起，海绵宝宝。

12:35.137 --> 12:38.965
BERETS ARE ONLY WORN BY TRUE
ARTISTS, LIKE MOI.
贝雷帽只有真正的人才会戴
艺术家，如莫伊。

12:39.068 --> 12:40.413
- YOU'RE AN ARTIST?
- 你是艺术家？

12:40.517 --> 12:41.758
- YES, I'M AN ARTIST.
- 是的，我是一名艺术家。

12:41.862 --> 12:43.448
WHAT ARE YOU TWO
BUBBLEHEADS DOING ANYWAY?
你们两个是什么
泡泡头在做什么？

12:43.551 --> 12:45.517
- WE'RE MAKING ARTS AND CRAFTS.
- 我们正在制作艺术品和工艺品。

12:45.620 --> 12:47.655
I'VE BEEN LEARNING THE FINE ART
OF BASKET WEAVING.
我一直在学习美术
篮子编织。

12:47.758 --> 12:51.034
I MADE THIS ONE USING DESIGNS
OF ME AND MY BEST FRIENDS.
我用设计做了这个
我和我最好的朋友们。

12:51.137 --> 12:53.137
AND I ALSO MADE THIS CUTE
LITTLE SCALLOP HOUSE.
我也把它做得很可爱
小扇贝屋。

12:53.241 --> 12:59.344
[squeaking]
[吱吱声]

12:59.448 --> 13:00.655
AND I MADE THIS WALLET.
我做了这个钱包。

13:00.758 --> 13:03.103
AND I CROCHETED MONEY
TO GO IN IT.
我编织了钱
进入其中。

13:03.206 --> 13:06.275
- SO, YOU'VE BEEN
COUNTERFEITING CURRENCY?
- 那么，你已经
伪造货币？

13:06.379 --> 13:08.862
AND WHAT HAS DOORKNOB
NUMBER TWO BEEN UP TO?
什么有门把手
第二名一直在做什么？

13:14.862 --> 13:18.551
- I'VE BEEN MAKING BASKETS, TOO.
- 我也一直在做篮子。

13:18.655 --> 13:19.896
DARN!
该死！

13:20.000 --> 13:22.172
THIS HAMMER IS DEFECTIVE.
这把锤子有缺陷。

13:22.275 --> 13:23.448
- DO YOU WANT TO MAKE CRAFTS,
TOO?
- 你想制作工艺品吗？
太？

13:23.551 --> 13:25.137
- CRAFTS?
- 工艺品？

13:25.241 --> 13:29.172
THIS ISN'T SUMMER CAMP.
I AM A TRUE ARTISTE.
这不是夏令营。
我是一个真正的艺术家。

13:29.275 --> 13:31.793
- MAN!
- 男人！

13:31.896 --> 13:37.413
I'LL NEVER MAKE ART LIKE
YOU AND SQUIDWARD.
我永远不会让艺术变得像
你和章鱼哥。

13:37.517 --> 13:40.586
- HEY, DON'T BE SAD.
YOU CAN BE AN ARTIST, TOO.
- 嘿，别伤心。
您也可以成为一名艺术家。

13:40.689 --> 13:42.896
I'LL FIND SOMETHING THAT WILL
TAP INTO YOUR PARTICULAR
我会找到可以的东西
挖掘您的具体情况

13:43.000 --> 13:44.241
ARTISTIC SKILL SET.
艺术技能。

13:44.344 --> 13:48.758
NOW LET ME SEE.
OH, THIS WILL BE PERFECT!
现在让我看看。
哦，这将是完美的！

13:48.862 --> 13:49.241
START WITH A ROCK.
从一块石头开始。

13:49.344 --> 13:50.241
- A WHAT?
- 什么？

13:50.344 --> 13:52.724
- A LITTLE GLUE.
- 一点胶水。

13:52.827 --> 13:53.965
- UH.
- 呃。

13:54.068 --> 13:56.689
- TAKE ON A COUPLE
OF GOOGLY EYES.
- 与一对情侣较量
瞪大眼睛。

13:56.793 --> 13:58.379
- WHOA!
SLOW DOWN, SPONGEBOB.
- 哇！
慢点，海绵宝宝。

13:58.482 --> 14:01.413
- AND PRESTO!
A ROCK WITH GOOGLY EYES.
- 急！
长着一双眼睛的岩石。

14:01.517 --> 14:04.965
- WHOA!
I DID NOT SEE THAT COMING!
- 哇！
我没有预见到这一点！

14:05.068 --> 14:07.172
- NOW YOU TRY.
- I'M SCARED.
- 现在你试试。
- 我很害怕。

14:07.275 --> 14:12.172
- YOU CAN DO THIS.
- I SHALL MAKE THE ATTEMPT.
- 你可以做到这一点。
- 我会尝试的。

14:12.275 --> 14:15.275
PRIVACY, PLEASE.
- SORRY.
请保护隐私。
- 对不起。

14:15.379 --> 14:19.103
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

14:19.206 --> 14:21.310
I DID IT!
- YEAH!
我做到了！
- 是的！

14:21.413 --> 14:22.793
LET'S TAKE A LOOK.
- BEHOLD...
让我们看一下。
- 看哪...

14:22.896 --> 14:24.655
[oozing]
[渗出]

14:24.758 --> 14:26.103
- AH!
OH!
- 啊！
哦！

14:26.206 --> 14:29.620
OOH, IT'S BEAUTIFUL!
哦，真漂亮！

14:29.724 --> 14:31.413
- I'M AN ARTIST!
- 我是一名艺术家！

14:31.517 --> 14:33.379
both: HOORAY!
两人：万岁！

14:33.482 --> 14:34.275
- HATE.
- 恨。

14:34.379 --> 14:35.965
- WHY, HELLO, MR. TENTACLES.
- 为什么，你好，先生。触手。

14:36.068 --> 14:38.655
I'M FREDERICK T. NITPICK,
WORLD FAMOUS ART CRITIC.
我是弗雷德里克·T·尼特皮克
世界著名艺术评论家。

14:38.758 --> 14:43.689
THIS IS YOUR ARTWORK, I PRESUME.
- OH, IT CERTAINLY IS.
我想这是你的艺术品。
- 哦，确实如此。

14:43.793 --> 14:45.827
THIS PIECE REPRESENTS
MY STRUGGLE
这件作品代表
我的奋斗

14:45.931 --> 14:49.241
TO REVEAL MY GENIUS
TO A MORONIC WORLD.
展现我的天才
走向一个白痴世界。

14:49.344 --> 14:53.655
WITNESS THE VENUS DE SQUIDWARD!
见证《章鱼哥的维纳斯》！

14:53.758 --> 14:54.827
STUNNING, ISN'T IT?
令人惊叹，不是吗？

14:54.931 --> 14:58.931
- MY CONSIDERED OPINION IS...
EW!
- 我深思熟虑的意见是......
呃！

14:59.034 --> 15:01.000
I'LL HAVE TO CONFISCATE YOUR
ARTIST BERET.
我必须没收你的
艺术家贝雷帽。

15:01.103 --> 15:02.655
- WHAT?
NO!
- 什么？
不！

15:02.758 --> 15:04.000
NO, YOU CAN'T DO THAT.
不，你不能那样做。

15:04.103 --> 15:05.724
- SORRY, BUT I'M LOOKING
FOR A REAL ARTIST.
- 抱歉，但我正在寻找
对于真正的艺术家。

15:05.827 --> 15:08.482
- I'M AN ARTIST!
HOORAY!
- 我是一名艺术家！
万岁！

15:08.586 --> 15:10.172
- AN ARTIST, EH?
- 艺术家，呃？

15:10.275 --> 15:12.379
- WHAT?
I--NO, COME BACK.
- 什么？
我——不，回来吧。

15:12.482 --> 15:14.965
- NOW, WHICH ONE OF YOU TWO IS
THE ARTISTE?
- 现在，你们两个中谁是
艺术家？

15:15.068 --> 15:17.103
- WE BOTH ARE.
IT'S LOTS OF FUN.
- 我们都是。
这很有趣。

15:17.206 --> 15:18.965
WOULD YOU LIKE TO MAKE
SOMETHING, TOO?
你想做吗
还有东西吗？

15:19.068 --> 15:22.103
- [laughter]
- [笑声]

15:26.206 --> 15:28.241
I'M A CRITIC.
我是批评家。

15:28.344 --> 15:31.689
I DON'T MAKE THINGS.
I JUDGE THINGS.
我不做东西。
我判断事情。

15:31.793 --> 15:34.862
I'M A JUDGER.
FOR INSTANCE, I JUDGE YOUR WORK.
我是一名法官。
例如，我评判你的工作。

15:34.965 --> 15:39.620
LAME.
瘸。

15:39.724 --> 15:42.068
- DON'T JUDGE ME.
- 别评判我。

15:42.172 --> 15:44.241
- HOLY GUACAMOLE FRIJOLES.
- 神圣的鳄梨酱菜豆。

15:44.344 --> 15:49.068
IT'S SO, SO PRIMITIVE AND NAIVE.
真是太原始太天真了。

15:49.172 --> 15:51.379
YOU'RE A GENIUS.
- IS THAT GOOD?
你是个天才。
- 这样好吗？

15:51.482 --> 15:53.344
- I'LL GIVE YOU
500 BUCKS FOR IT.
- 我会给你
500 美元。

15:53.448 --> 15:55.241
AND THIS HAT.
还有这顶帽子。

15:55.344 --> 15:56.344
- HEY!
- 嘿！

15:56.448 --> 15:59.241
- YOU ARE A MASTER
ARTIST, MY FRIEND.
- 你是大师
艺术家，我的朋友。

15:59.344 --> 16:02.413
- YOU CAN'T GIVE THAT DUNDERHEAD
THE ARTIST HAT.
- 你不能提供那个DUNDERHEAD
艺术家帽。

16:02.517 --> 16:05.862
- WHO'S THE CRITIC HERE?
- WOW!
- 谁是这里的批评者？
- 哇！

16:05.965 --> 16:07.068
DID YOU HEAR THAT, SQUIDWARD?
你听到了吗，章鱼哥？

16:07.172 --> 16:08.896
PATRICK IS AN ARTIST.
帕特里克是一位艺术家。

16:09.000 --> 16:10.379
- OH!
- 哦！

16:10.482 --> 16:13.448
SELLING ONE LOUSY PIECE DOESN'T
MAKE YOU AN ARTIST.
卖掉一件糟糕的作品并不重要
让你成为一名艺术家。

16:13.551 --> 16:15.724
- HOW MANY LOUSY PIECES HAVE YOU
SOLD, SQUIDWARD?
- 你有多少件糟糕的作品
卖了，章鱼哥？

16:15.827 --> 16:17.827
- WELL, ABOUT UM...UM...
- 嗯，关于嗯……嗯……

16:17.931 --> 16:19.068
WELL, I BET HE WON'T SELL
好吧，我打赌他不会卖

16:19.172 --> 16:21.379
ANOTHER ONE OF THOSE
RIDICULOUS TRINKETS.
另一个
可笑的小饰品。

16:21.482 --> 16:22.965
- HEY THERE.
I NOTICED YOUR HAT.
- 嘿。
我注意到你的帽子了。

16:23.068 --> 16:24.965
ARE YOU AN ARTIST?
- I SURE AM.
您是艺术家吗？
- 我当然是。

16:25.068 --> 16:26.310
- DO YOU HAVE ANY ART?
- 你有艺术吗？

16:26.413 --> 16:28.103
I HAVE A REAL CRAVING
FOR CREATIVITY.
我有一个真正的渴望
为了创造力。

16:28.206 --> 16:30.793
- UH.
OKAY.
- 呃。
好的。

16:37.206 --> 16:39.103
- ART!
- THANKS, MAN.
- 艺术！
- 谢谢，伙计。

16:39.206 --> 16:41.034
HERE'S 50 BUCKS.
这是 50 美元。

16:41.137 --> 16:43.413
- I'LL BET HE NEVER
SELLS ANOTHER.
- 我敢打赌他永远不会
又卖了一个。

16:43.517 --> 16:45.310
- HEY, TED.
WHERE'D YOU GET THAT ART?
- 嘿，泰德。
你从哪里得到这些艺术品？

16:45.413 --> 16:47.172
- FROM THAT PINK
GENIUS OVER THERE.
- 从那个粉红色开始
天才在那儿。

16:47.275 --> 16:48.931
- I WANT TO BUY ONE.
- ME TOO.
- 我想买一个。
- 我也是。

16:49.034 --> 16:50.206
- I ALSO.
- 我也。

16:50.310 --> 16:51.724
- I'LL BET--
- SQUIDWARD I THINK WE SHOULD
- 我敢打赌--
- 章鱼哥 我想我们应该

16:51.827 --> 16:53.931
HAVE A LITTLE TALK ABOUT YOUR
GAMBLING PROBLEM.
谈谈你的
赌博问题。

16:54.034 --> 16:55.172
- HMM.
- 唔。

16:55.275 --> 16:58.310
I ACTUALLY WANT TO
GO TO WORK TODAY.
我其实想要
今天去上班。

16:58.413 --> 17:00.172
- WHOA!
- 哇！

17:00.275 --> 17:01.862
I'M ALMOST LATE TO
BE EARLY FOR WORK.
我快要迟到了
早点上班。

17:01.965 --> 17:03.448
SEE YOU LATER, PATRICK.
稍后见，帕特里克。

17:03.551 --> 17:09.793
- UH, SO LONG MY DEAR, EARNEST,
YET UNTALENTED FRIEND.
- 呃，再见，亲爱的，真诚的，
但没有才华的朋友。

17:09.896 --> 17:12.172
- ONE FOR YOU.
AND ONE FOR YOU.
- 为您准备的一款。
还有一款适合您。

17:12.275 --> 17:16.586
AND ONE...UH...
还有一个……呃……

17:16.689 --> 17:19.068
UH, I'VE RUN OUT OF ROCKS TO PUT
GOOGLY EYES ON.
呃，我已经没有石头可以放了
目瞪口呆。

17:19.172 --> 17:22.827
I'VE RUN OUT OF ROCKS.
- GOT ANYTHING ELSE?
我的石头已经用完了。
- 还有什么吗？

17:22.931 --> 17:24.793
- THE ARTIST NEEDS ALONE TIME.
- 艺术家需要独处的时间。

17:24.896 --> 17:27.517
- HE'S SO ECCENTRIC.
- 他太古怪了。

17:30.655 --> 17:34.206
- I'M ALL OUT OF ROCKS.
WHAT AM I GOING TO DO NOW?
- 我已经没有石头了。
我现在要做什么？

17:34.310 --> 17:36.448
THAT WAS MY THING.
那是我的事。

17:36.551 --> 17:38.482
OH!
哦！

17:46.551 --> 17:48.896
TARTER SAUCE.
塔特酱。

17:59.896 --> 18:01.655
THAT STINKS, TOO.
那也很臭。

18:01.758 --> 18:06.448
- THE ARTIST NEEDS A LUNCH
BREAK.
- 艺术家需要吃午餐
打破。

18:11.241 --> 18:14.965
- OH!
NOT YOU AGAIN.
- 哦！
又不是你了。

18:15.068 --> 18:16.965
MAY I TAKE YOUR ORDER?
我可以接受您的订单吗？

18:17.068 --> 18:24.310
- HMM...
- 唔...

18:24.413 --> 18:28.000
I'M THINKING ABOUT HAVING
A KRABBY PATTY.
我正在考虑拥有
蟹肉饼。

18:28.103 --> 18:31.310
- ONE KRABBY PATTY.
- 一份蟹肉饼。

18:31.413 --> 18:34.413
- BUT I WONDER IF THAT MIGHT BE
TOO PREDICTABLE.
- 但我想知道是否可能是这样
太可预测了。

18:34.517 --> 18:37.344
- THEN WHAT DO YOU WANT?
- 那你想要什么？

18:37.448 --> 18:38.620
- I DON'T KNOW.
- 我不知道。

18:38.724 --> 18:41.965
I'M NOT FEELING
INSPIRED AT THE MOMENT.
我没有感觉
此刻的灵感。

18:42.068 --> 18:43.172
- HIYA, PATRICK.
- 你好，帕特里克。

18:43.275 --> 18:45.413
ORDERING UP A DELICIOUS
KRABBY PATTY?
点一份美味的
蟹肉饼？

18:45.517 --> 18:46.689
- MAYBE.
I DON'T KNOW.
- 或许。
我不知道。

18:46.793 --> 18:48.896
I'M IN A CREATIVE SLUMP.
我的创造力陷入低谷。

18:49.000 --> 18:51.793
- OH, PATRICK, THAT'S TERRIBLE.
- JUST ORDER ALREADY!
- 哦，帕特里克，那太糟糕了。
- 已经订购了！

18:51.896 --> 18:53.137
- OKAY.
- 好的。

18:53.241 --> 18:55.310
I WANT NEW IDEAS TO SATISFY
我想要新的想法来满足

18:55.413 --> 18:57.517
A PUBLIC HUNGER FOR
MY GOOGLY GOODS.
公众的渴望
我的好东西。

18:57.620 --> 19:01.413
- OFF THE MENU.
CHOOSE SOMETHING OFF THE MENU.
- 关闭菜单。
从菜单上选择一些东西。

19:01.517 --> 19:03.517
WE DON'T SERVE
ARTISTIC ADVICE HERE.
我们不提供服务
艺术建议在这里。

19:03.620 --> 19:08.241
- THEN WHY IS IT ON THE MENU?
- 那为什么它会出现在菜单上？

19:08.344 --> 19:09.896
- GET BACK TO WORK, SQUIDWARD.
- 回去工作吧，章鱼哥。

19:10.000 --> 19:13.655
- IN CASE YOU HAVEN'T NOTICED,
THIS IS NOT AN ARTIST'S HAT.
- 如果你还没有注意到，
这不是艺术家的帽子。

19:13.758 --> 19:17.034
[heavy breathing]
[粗重的呼吸]

19:17.137 --> 19:22.034
- OH, YOU CAN BORROW MINE.
- 哦，你可以借我的。

19:22.137 --> 19:24.103
- BEAUTIFUL.
- 美丽的。

19:24.206 --> 19:26.310
- MAKE YOURSELF COMFORTABLE,
MR. PATRICK.
- 让自己舒服，
先生。帕特里克。

19:26.413 --> 19:28.896
OUR ARTISTIC CONSULTANT WILL BE
RIGHT WITH YOU.
我们的艺术顾问将是
就在你身边。

19:29.000 --> 19:30.413
THIS IS MR. TENTACLES.
这是先生。触手。

19:30.517 --> 19:32.724
HE'LL BE HANDLING ALL YOUR
ARTISTIC ADVICE NEEDS.
他会处理你的一切
艺术建议需求。

19:32.827 --> 19:34.068
- MM-HMM.
- 嗯嗯。

19:34.172 --> 19:36.103
- MM-HMM.
PLEASURE.
- 嗯嗯。
乐趣。

19:36.206 --> 19:38.586
- HERE'S YOUR KRABBY PATTY.
SHALL I PUT IT ON YOUR TAB?
- 这是你的蟹肉饼。
我可以把它放在你的标签上吗？

19:38.689 --> 19:40.172
- OH, YEAH.
KEEP IT OPEN.
- 哦，是的。
保持打开状态。

19:40.275 --> 19:43.275
WE MIGHT BE HERE ALL NIGHT.
我们可能会在这里待一整晚。

19:43.379 --> 19:47.379
LET ME JUST SAY,
RIGHT UP FRONT, I'M A FAN.
我只想说，
首先，我是粉丝。

19:47.482 --> 19:51.413
I'M EXCITED TO
LEARN FROM A MASTER.
我很兴奋
向大师学习。

19:51.517 --> 19:54.620
MY CAREER AND SELF-WORTH
ARE IN YOUR HANDS.
我的职业和自我价值
就在你的手中。

19:54.724 --> 19:58.413
A LOT IS RIDING ON THIS.
OKAY...
这有很多因素。
好的...

19:58.517 --> 20:01.275
ADVISE.
- [sighs]
建议。
- [叹气]

20:01.379 --> 20:07.206
WHY DON'T YOU JUST
CONCENTRATE ON YOUR PATTY?
你为什么不只是
专注于你的肉饼？

20:07.310 --> 20:09.000
- WHAT? AH!
OF COURSE!
- 什么？啊！
当然！

20:09.103 --> 20:11.758
IT'S SO OBVIOUS NOW.
HOW DID I NOT SEE IT EARLIER?
现在就很明显了。
我怎么没早点看到呢？

20:11.862 --> 20:14.931
SQUIDWARD'S A GENIUS.
章鱼哥是个天才。

20:15.034 --> 20:18.586
I KNOW NOW WHAT I MUST DO!
我现在知道我必须做什么！

20:27.655 --> 20:30.965
- BRILLIANT.
- 杰出的。

20:31.068 --> 20:34.793
I'VE NEVER SEEN SUCH AN
EXAMPLE OF RAW CREATIVITY.
我从未见过这样的
原始创造力的例子。

20:34.896 --> 20:38.172
THIS WILL TURN THE
ART WORLD ON ITS HEAD.
这将转变
艺术世界尽在掌握。

20:38.275 --> 20:42.448
I HEREBY DECLARE THIS
THE NEXT BIG THING!
我特此声明
下一件大事！

20:42.551 --> 20:44.172
THE NEXT BIG THING...
下一件大事...

20:44.275 --> 20:45.241
...THING.
...事物。

20:45.344 --> 20:49.137
...THING.
...事物。

20:49.241 --> 20:52.000
[noise]
[噪音]

20:52.103 --> 20:55.724
- YOU DID IT, PATRICK.
YOU FOUND YOUR INSPIRATION.
- 你做到了，帕特里克。
您找到了灵感。

20:55.827 --> 20:57.724
- THEN I'M GONNA NEED MORE OF
THOSE PATTY THINGIES.
- 那我需要更多
那些馅饼的东西。

20:57.827 --> 21:01.068
- YOU GOT IT, BUDDY.
- 你明白了，伙计。

21:14.275 --> 21:17.310
- HUH?
- 嗯？

21:17.413 --> 21:19.758
OOOH!
MONEY!
噢！
钱！

21:19.862 --> 21:21.655
MONEY, MONEY, MONEY, MONEY,
MONEY...
钱，钱，钱，钱，
钱...

21:21.758 --> 21:24.931
MONEY, MONEY, MONEY, MONEY,
MONEY...
钱，钱，钱，钱，
钱...

21:25.034 --> 21:25.482
[screams]
[尖叫声]

21:25.586 --> 21:27.310
WHAT THE...
什么...

21:27.413 --> 21:30.655
[screams]
[尖叫声]

21:30.758 --> 21:32.931
HUH?
嗯？

21:33.034 --> 21:34.310
SPONGEBOB!
海绵宝宝！

21:34.413 --> 21:37.413
PATRICK!
帕特里克！

21:43.275 --> 21:44.793
WHAT'S THE MEANING OF THIS?
这是什么意思？

21:44.896 --> 21:47.000
- IT'S MY ART.
- 这是我的艺术。

21:47.103 --> 21:49.517
I BUY KRABBY PATTIES
FOR $3,
我买蟹肉饼
3 美元，

21:49.620 --> 21:53.551
AND I SELL THEM FOR 50.
我以 50 美元的价格出售它们。

21:53.655 --> 21:54.344
[snarls]
[咆哮]

21:54.448 --> 21:56.655
both: [crying]
两人：[哭泣]

21:56.758 --> 21:58.620
- HA AND HA.
- 哈哈。

21:58.724 --> 22:00.103
- WHY'S HE SO MAD, SQUIDWARD?
- 章鱼哥他为什么这么生气？

22:00.206 --> 22:03.137
I WAS JUST FOLLOWING YOUR
ADVICE.
我只是在关注你的
建议。

22:03.241 --> 22:04.448
- WHAT?
- 什么？

22:04.551 --> 22:07.896
IT WAS YOUR IDEA, HUH?
这是你的主意，嗯？

22:08.000 --> 22:11.000
[polka music]
[波尔卡音乐]

22:11.103 --> 22:14.551
- HERE'S OUR NEW BATCH OF PIPING
HOT KRABBY PATTY CANVASES.
- 这是我们的新一批管道
热蟹肉饼画布。

22:14.655 --> 22:18.931
- GREAT, SPONGEBOB.
THAT'LL BE 50 BUCKS.
- 太棒了，海绵宝宝。
那是 50 美元。

22:19.034 --> 22:21.620
- IT'S SO INEXPENSIVE.
- AND HERE'S YOUR PATTY.
- 太便宜了。
- 这是你的肉饼。

22:21.724 --> 22:23.758
ONE MORE ART PATTY, MR. STAR.
又一件艺术派蒂先生，星星。

22:23.862 --> 22:25.827
- IT'S SUCH AN
HONOR TO MEET YOU.
- 就是这样
很荣幸认识您。

22:25.931 --> 22:29.758
- I CAN ONLY IMAGINE.
APPRENTICE!
- 我只能想象。
学徒！

22:29.862 --> 22:35.137
MAKE ANOTHER OF MY
MASTERPIECES, GOOD MAN.
制作另一个我的
杰作，好人。

22:35.241 --> 22:38.413
IF YOU WORK REAL HARD, YOU MAY
BE AN ARTIST TOO SOMEDAY.
如果你真的努力工作，你可能会
有一天也成为一名艺术家。

22:38.517 --> 22:41.000
- [growling]
- [咆哮]

22:41.103 --> 22:43.344
- HMM.
PROBABLY NOT.
- 唔。
可能不是。

22:43.448 --> 22:45.896
IT NEEDS MORE GLITTER.
它需要更多的闪光。

22:46.000 --> 22:47.896
- [grumbling, weeping]
- [抱怨，哭泣]

22:48.000 --> 22:52.206
